import json,re,sys
F='/root/.claude/projects/-home-user-fortress/fe616d40-a9c6-56d7-9da1-7168a172765d.jsonl'
out=[]
for l in open(F):
    try:d=json.loads(l)
    except:continue
    ts=d.get('timestamp','')
    if not('2026-11-08T06'<=ts[:13]<='2026-11-08T16'):continue
    m=d.get('message') or {}
    c=m.get('content')
    t=d.get('type')
    if t=='user':
        if isinstance(c,list):
            if any(b.get('type')=='tool_result' for b in c if isinstance(b,dict)):continue
            c='\n'.join(b.get('text','') for b in c if isinstance(b,dict) and b.get('type')=='text')
        if not isinstance(c,str):continue
        c=re.sub(r'<system-reminder>.*?</system-reminder>','',c,flags=re.S).strip()
        if c:out.append((ts,'U',c))
    elif t=='assistant' and isinstance(c,list):
        s='\n'.join(b.get('text','') for b in c if b.get('type')=='text').strip()
        if s:out.append((ts,'A',s))
json.dump(out,open('numeral-fidelity/all.json','w'))
print(len(out),sum(1 for o in out if o[1]=='U'))
for i,o in enumerate(out):
    if o[1]=='U':print(i,o[0],len(o[2]),o[2][:90].replace('\n',' '))
